   "as_received": "B9. The undocumented `_processChunk` surface is tied to the pinned Node versions. State which pin it is tied to, taking the versions from kitchen's real pin, not from memory. Make a different runtime refuse or be flagged rather than silently trusted.",
   "left_to_the_implementer": "Refuse or flag. Chosen: refuse.",
   "pin": {
